---
---

<section class="philanthropy">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Profit With <span class="highlight">Purpose</span></h2>

    <p class="section-intro">
      Ancestro commits a minimum of <strong>5% of profits</strong> to regenerative initiatives, including:
    </p>

    <div class="impact-grid">
      <div class="impact-card">
        <div class="impact-icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/>
            <line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="3"/><line x1="12" y1="21" x2="12" y2="23"/>
            <line x1="4.22" y1="4.22" x2="5.64" y2="5.64"/><line x1="18.36" y1="18.36" x2="19.78" y2="19.78"/>
            <line x1="1" y1="12" x2="3" y2="12"/><line x1="21" y1="12" x2="23" y2="12"/>
            <line x1="4.22" y1="19.78" x2="5.64" y2="18.36"/><line x1="18.36" y1="5.64" x2="19.78" y2="4.22"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Free Solar for Communities</h3>
        <p>Installations for underserved communities worldwide</p>
      </div>
      <div class="impact-card">
        <div class="impact-icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path d="M12 22c-4 0-8-2-8-6s4-6 8-10c4 4 8 6 8 10s-4 6-8 6z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Amazon Reforestation</h3>
        <p>Rainforest preservation and reforestation programs</p>
      </div>
      <div class="impact-card">
        <div class="impact-icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path d="M2 12C2 6.48 6.48 2 12 2c2.76 0 5.26 1.12 7.07 2.93"/>
            <path d="M22 12c0 5.52-4.48 10-10 10-2.76 0-5.26-1.12-7.07-2.93"/>
            <path d="M12 8v8"/><path d="M8 12h8"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Ocean Plastic Removal</h3>
        <p>Active cleanup and prevention initiatives</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="closing">Impact is not an afterthought. <span>It is embedded into the operating model.</span></p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .philanthropy {
    padding: 100px 24px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, rgba(248,176,59,0.02) 50%, transparent 100%);
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3.5vw, 36px);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-white);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .highlight {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .section-intro {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .section-intro strong {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .impact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .impact-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 36px 24px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .impact-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(248,176,59,0.2);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  .impact-icon {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: rgba(248,176,59,0.1);
    border-radius: 14px;
    margin: 0 auto 20px;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .impact-card h3 {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-white);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .impact-card p {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .closing {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
  }

  .closing span {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .philanthropy {
      padding: 60px 20px;
    }

    .impact-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
